Package: ooaudit
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: ACTION LEDGER
 Immutable audit recorder logging system calls, IO streams, and agent decisions.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 hash-chain tamper detection, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
